-- INVISIBLE SPACE -------------------------------------------- main.kl  SEC0103

I found U+00A0 (NO-BREAK SPACE), a space that is not the ordinary space U+0020. Kalam code uses only the ordinary space, so an invisible character can never split or join words.

9│     let n = total(xs)
              ^

Try: ` `

Help: Replace it with an ordinary space. `kalam fix` does this for you.

Learn more: kalam explain SEC0103
